  "description": "Try Ladder COMPLETELY FREE for 7 days. NO PAYMENT collected during trial.\n\nLADDER IS THE #1 APP FOR STRENGTH TRAINING\nApple's 2025 App of the Year Finalist\nApple's Editors Choice Award\nWomen's Health 2026 Best Overall\nCNET 2026 Best Strength Training App\n\nLadder gives you a structured, coach-built workout plan for every day — new each week, easy to follow, and designed for home or gym. No more guesswork, no more showing up not knowing what to do.\n\nA NEW WORKOUT PLAN EVERY DAY — Structured progressive overload programs created by expert coaches, matched to your goals.\nBUILT FOR STRENGTH TRAINING — In-ear coaching, video demonstrations and a built-in timer.\nTRAIN ON YOUR SCHEDULE — Workouts that fit your life and can be done from anywhere.\nTRACK YOUR PROGRESS — Use the Ladder Journal to visualize your rep and weight progress over time.\n\nWORKOUT STYLES INCLUDE:\nYoga Strength\nPilates Strength Training\nInterval Strength Training\nPush Pull Training\nKettlebell Strength Workouts\nHIIT (High Intensity Interval Training)\nBodybuilding\nBodyweight Workouts\nExplosive Power\nStrength & Conditioning\nFunctional Fitness\nEndurance Strength\n\nPROGRAMS & COACHES:\nALIGN (Sasha Hanway) — Power Vinyasa meets strength training to build balance and full-body strength.\nASCEND (Aria Vince) — Traditional bodybuilding with a focus on glutes, shoulders and back using barbells, dumbbells and machines.\nBODY & BELL (Lauren Kanski) — Functional, high-intensity kettlebell workouts.\nCREWS CONTROL (Andre Crews) — High-intensity functional fitness for strength and athleticism.\nDEFINE (Maia Henry) — The 3-2-1 method: three days strength, two days Pilates, one conditioning day with daily core work.\nELEVATE (Elise Young) — Fast-paced HIIT workouts designed to maximize your time.\nEMBODY (Allegra Paris) — Low-impact Pilates and strength training focused on full-body movement, glute development and core strength.\nENDURE (Jennifer Jacobs) — Progressive overload strength combining smart programming, intentional recovery and sustainable intensity.\nEVOLVE (Samantha Lindauer) — Balanced hypertrophy and structured progression in under 45 minutes a day.\nFORGED (Corey Perkins) — Structured bodybuilding focused on hypertrophy and progressive strength development.\nFORMATION (Robin Barrett) — High-tempo combination circuits for strength and endurance in 30 minutes a day.\nLIMITLESS (Kelly Matthews) — Traditional strength, high-intensity conditioning and steady state cardio for total athleticism.\nMAXIMUS (Bobby Maximus & Joe Cebula) — No-frills, garage-style HIIT for strength and conditioning.\nMOVEWELL (Nicole Winter) — High-energy, minimal equipment strength workouts in just 30 minutes a day.\nPROJECT ALPHA (Sam Tooley) — Hybrid circuit and HIIT training engineered for results.\nRESILIENT (Neen Williams) — Kettlebell and barbell training for explosive power and speed.\nTHRIVE (Nairee Kiana) — Glute and core-focused, dumbbell-only progressive overload with functional strength and Pilates-inspired core work.\nTRANSFORM (Shelby) — Strength and conditioning combining heavy lower body work with upper body training and mobility.\nVERSA (Abbie Dennison) — Hybrid strength training blending resistance work with cardiovascular conditioning for peak performance.\nVITALITY (Brian Pruett) — Minimal-equipment functional bodybuilding in 30-45 minutes a day.\n\nTERMS OF SERVICE\nhttps://joinladder.com/terms\n\nLove Ladder? We would love to hear from you! Rate and review us in the App Store or drop us a note at hello@joinladder.com!",
